# lab.surface: the k -> m game (games/lab-kxm) on the lab surface of the test map, inside the
# router worker's lab region (x 880..1010, y 400..640), so fk build's diff and apply can be
# watched live (/lab). The lab rules: free materials, direct building.
surface  lab
mode     lab
terrain  none
catalog  base

place kxm = kxm plot 890,410 30x24
